#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Use a quantum computer today*! The goal of this course is for you to run code on a real quantum computer in the shortest time possible, with no prior background required. Let's get started.\n"
msgstr "Maligayang pagdating sa *Use a quantum computer today*! Ang layunin ng kursong ito ay para makapagpatakbo ka ng code sa isang tunay na quantum computer sa pinakamabilis na panahong posible, nang walang kinakailangang prior background. Magsimula na tayo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
