msgid "Learning objective {#learning-objective}"
msgstr "Layunin sa pag-aaral {#learning-objective}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now that we've walked through how to create the $\\Phi^+$ Bell state, see if you can edit the code to create one of the other three [Bell states](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state#Bell_basis). In particular, the $\\Psi^-$ state will be used in an upcoming lesson, so if you figure out how to create it, you'll be ahead of the game.\n"
msgstr "Ngayong nakapaglakad na tayo sa kung paano lumikha ng $\\Phi^+$ Bell state, tingnan kung maaari mong i-edit ang code para lumikha ng isa pa sa tatlong [Bell states](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state#Bell_basis). Sa partikular, ang $\\Psi^-$ state ay gagamitin sa isang paparating na aralin, kaya kung malalaman mo kung paano ito gawin, mauuna ka na sa laro.\n"
